   "body": "/claim mac/M1\n\n- Hypothesis: `ignoresSafeArea` wraps the `GeometryReader`, so it reports zero insets and the web view gets no top or bottom inset (same cause as #641's top edge).\n- Test first: a hosted view with a known safe area must hand those insets to its content; seen red, then move the `GeometryReader` outside the ignore.\n- Fix the class: one `ReaderUnderBars` wrapper for both edges, no other change.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
